{"id":"81bf35e8ff6390c3","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-preevaluation-live-support.md","title":"预求值扩张恰保留可求值支撑","display":"thm-preevaluation-live-support — 预求值扩张恰保留可求值支撑","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-preevaluation-live-support","aliases":["72-thm-preevaluation-live-support"],"display":"thm-preevaluation-live-support — 预求值扩张恰保留可求值支撑","depends_on":["[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X value-respecting PERs and pre-evaluation extension, print746/PDF758; local exact support formula","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-preevaluation-live-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-preevaluation-live-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-preevaluation-live-support — 预求值扩张恰保留可求值支撑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b9c13fa158735675\" href=\"?note=b9c13fa158735675\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift\">72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X value-respecting PERs and pre-evaluation extension, print746/PDF758; local exact support formula"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\Downarrow\">\\(D_\\Downarrow\\)</span> 为下式的可求值项集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\Downarrow:=\\{t\\in T:\\exists v\\in T\\ (t\\Downarrow v)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\Downarrow:=\\{t\\in T:\\exists v\\in T\\ (t\\Downarrow v)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^\\Downarrow=R\\cap D_\\Downarrow^2,\\qquad\nR^\\Downarrow=R\\Longleftrightarrow|R|\\subseteq D_\\Downarrow.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^\\Downarrow=R\\cap D_\\Downarrow^2,\\qquad\nR^\\Downarrow=R\\Longleftrightarrow|R|\\subseteq D_\\Downarrow.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若tRu且两端有值v,w，则t与v、u与w分别Kleene相等；R的饱和性及对称性将原边转成vRw，因此tR↓u。反向对扩张见证vRw，用两端Kleene相等及饱和性取回tRu，两端当然可求值。于是得到交式；PER只连接支撑元素，故交式等于R恰在支撑全部可求值时成立。不能从值相容本身推断成员都停机。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift","status":"resolved","id":"b9c13fa158735675","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\Downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\Downarrow:=\\{t\\in T:\\exists v\\in T\\ (t\\Downarrow v)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"R^\\Downarrow=R\\cap D_\\Downarrow^2,\\qquad\nR^\\Downarrow=R\\Longleftrightarrow|R|\\subseteq D_\\Downarrow.","display":true}],"bytes":1492,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per